        "text": "In September, China's combustion vehicle (ICE) sales dropped to just a third of the market for the first time\n\nBattery electric vehicles are getting close to half of the market (47.3%), while Plug-ins added another 19.7%.\n\nOnly 5 years from >90% to 33% ICE.",
