      "type": "转发",
      "type_label": "转发",
      "text": "BREAKING: United just launched a Starlink tracker so you can check if your next flight has Starlink Wi-Fi and follow its rollout across the fleet.\n\nWith 635+ United aircraft already connected, finding Starlink in the sky just got easier.\n\nhttps://starlinktracker.united.com/program/starlink",
